'''IFB Home Appliances''' is an Indian [[home appliance]]s company and a division of '''IFB Industries'''.<ref name=IFBAppliances>{{cite web|title=About Us|url=https://www.ifbappliances.com/about-us/about-ifb/ |website=IFB Appliances|accessdate=27 January 2017}}</ref> It has its manufacturing locations in [[Kolkata]] and [[Verna, Goa]]. The company has a chain of ~530 retail outlets called ‘IFB Point’.<ref name="Business Standard">{{cite news|title=IFB Industries Ltd. Company History|url=http://www.business-standard.com/company/ifb-inds-281/information/company-history|newspaper=Business Standard India}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/india/stockpricequote/consumer-goods-white-goods/ifbindustries/IFB02|title = IFB Industries Share Price, IFB Industries Stock Price, IFB Industries LTD. Stock Price, Share Price, Live BSE/NSE, IFB Industries LTD. Bids Offers. Buy/Sell IFB Industries LTD. News & tips, & F&O Quotes, NSE/BSE Forecast News and Live Quotes | last1=Com | first1=Moneycontrol }}</ref>

== History ==
Originally IFB Industries was known as Indian Fine Blanks Ltd and started operations in India in 1974 in collaboration with Heinrich Schmid AG of Switzerland.<ref>{{cite web|title=IFB Industries Ltd|url=http://economictimes.indiatimes.com/ifb-industries-ltd/infocompanyhistory/companyid-13568.cms|website=The Economic Times}}</ref> In 1989, it entered an agreement with [[BSH Hausgeräte|Bosch-Siemens Hausgerate]] to produce fully-automatic washing machines and other domestic appliances.<ref>{{cite news |title=IFB stops CBU imports, begins mass production |url=https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/goa/ifb-stops-cbu-imports-begins-mass-production/articleshow/46221772.cms |access-date=12 November 2021 |work=The Times of India |language=en}}</ref> The Home Appliances Division started in 1990-91.<ref>{{cite news |title=IFB Industries starts production from Goa factory |url=https://www.business-standard.com/article/pti-stories/ifb-industries-starts-production-from-goa-factory-115021200398_1.html |access-date=26 November 2022 |work=Business Standard}}</ref> The factory is based at Verna Industrial Estate, Verna, Goa, India and Visveswariah Industrial Estate, Bengaluru, India.{{Citation needed|date=November 2025}}

== Products ==
The company currently offers products for laundry, kitchen, living and industrial purposes along with additives and accessories.<ref name=IFBAppliances /> It offers appliances such as [[washing machines]], [[washer-dryer]]s, [[Clothes dryer|laundry dryers]], [[dishwashers]], [[microwave ovens]], [[Air conditioning|air conditioners]], [[Refrigerators ]], [[Kitchen stove|hobs]], [[chimney]]s and other cooking appliances.<ref>{{cite web|title=IFB Industries Ltd|url=https://www.nseindia.com/content/corporate/eq_IFBIND_base.pdf|website=NSE India|accessdate=27 January 2017}}</ref>

